# The story mode, from the first step to the last
#   scene <name>   play assets/story/scenes/<name>.scene
#   stage <name>   drive the level levels/<name>
#
# All stages are test-level until the real stages exist. The name of the real stage is in the comment.
#
# The story in short:
#   Zlo wants to buy the village bingo hall and make it a datacenter. Rajka, a rally champion of the
#   1970s, enters the regional rally season to win the prize money. Her old car is gone, so she drives
#   the family Jugo 65, with her car-sick grandson Luka on the map. Her old co-driver Jelka now drives
#   for Zlo. The two fell out in 1978, when Jelka called "flat right", Rajka lifted, and they went into
#   a lake and lost the title. In the final, on the same lake road, Rajka takes the corner flat and wins.
#   Jelka was right all along. They make up, Jelka leaves Zlo, and the bingo hall is saved.
#
# The past is told in three flashbacks: the glory days (02), the crash (06), and the fight after it (06).

scene 00_intro
stage test-level        # 0: village_road, the tutorial, day

scene 01_club_rally
stage test-level        # 1: club_rally, the map, day

scene 02_glory_days
stage test-level        # 2: forest, map events start (the sick bag), overcast

scene 03_sick_bag
scene 04_mud
stage test-level        # 3: mud, the grip changes, rain

scene 05_night_talk
stage test-level        # 4: night, a light for the map, night

scene 06_the_lake
stage test-level        # 5: lake, the final, Rajka must win, dusk

scene 07_ending
